READ ME

BayesTraits.R is the code file used for the analyses in R.

GroupNames.csv states all species names in the analysis. Tree.trees - Tree file for the BayesTraits analysis.

BayesTraits.csv - Column 1 = Species Name. Column 2 = Egg Colour (T = Transparent, C = Carotenoid, G = Green, W = Guanine and M = Melanin).

There is one file for BayesTraits input (EggColour.txt) and two files for the results of the BayesTraits analyses (.Log and .Schedule).
